  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Select the request",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Drones</strong>, on <strong>Requests</strong>, tap the request. <strong>Message</strong> and <strong>Decline</strong> show under it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1736c03b47d3e135.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Message the asker",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Message opens ATAK's chat with the asker, here <strong>ALPHA-1</strong>. Ask before you decline.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8741662d32fc4602.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Decline it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Go back to <strong>Drones</strong>, tap the request again, then Decline. Pick why, such as <strong>Weather</strong>, and the asker is told.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/25b154800f53da38.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Undo in time",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Undo</strong> takes it back for 5 seconds. Then the request leaves your list.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/22008fed145061ca.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The asker sees it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the asker's phone the request says <strong>Declined</strong> and why, here <strong>Declined: weather</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7bd2fc77a816b852.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
